        "name": "Little H.O.P.E.",
        "steam_appid": 3852810,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852810/extras/f5453fb668e3cadc6f7b79bc8fb681ec.webp?t=1756845183\" width=600 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where humans no longer exist, the robot H.O.P.E. is the only one capable of convincing her mechanical friends to live in harmony with nature. H.O.P.E. has awoken from a centuries-long slumber and no longer understands the world or language of today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852810/extras/9f7353f6cad3e8f6a2a2a8d12f745e09.webp?t=1756845183\" width=600 height=54 /></span>Thanks to H.O.P.E.'s inventor, she is able to learn a special language by observing and interacting with her surroundings. These intriguing symbols carry different meanings that only you can uncover and combine in creative ways to communicate with robots and animals, making your way through this abandoned environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852810/extras/d14d46f684993e3859568cfac612d384.webp?t=1756845183\" width=600 height=54 /></span>The little robot will face challenges, riddles, and puzzles that can only be solved through communication and knowledge, whether it is a combination of levers, strange symbols scattered in different places, or confused worker robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852810/extras/d82b1e4a6121410ac9d2b2b8dbd12abd.webp?t=1756845183\" width=600 height=54 /></span>By understanding the mysterious language of this dystopian future, you can create a new world where technology and nature come together, and this time, there is a little hope!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852810/extras/f5453fb668e3cadc6f7b79bc8fb681ec.webp?t=1756845183\" width=600 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where humans no longer exist, the robot H.O.P.E. is the only one capable of convincing her mechanical friends to live in harmony with nature. H.O.P.E. has awoken from a centuries-long slumber and no longer understands the world or language of today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852810/extras/9f7353f6cad3e8f6a2a2a8d12f745e09.webp?t=1756845183\" width=600 height=54 /></span>Thanks to H.O.P.E.'s inventor, she is able to learn a special language by observing and interacting with her surroundings. These intriguing symbols carry different meanings that only you can uncover and combine in creative ways to communicate with robots and animals, making your way through this abandoned environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852810/extras/d14d46f684993e3859568cfac612d384.webp?t=1756845183\" width=600 height=54 /></span>The little robot will face challenges, riddles, and puzzles that can only be solved through communication and knowledge, whether it is a combination of levers, strange symbols scattered in different places, or confused worker robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852810/extras/d82b1e4a6121410ac9d2b2b8dbd12abd.webp?t=1756845183\" width=600 height=54 /></span>By understanding the mysterious language of this dystopian future, you can create a new world where technology and nature come together, and this time, there is a little hope!</p>",
        "short_description": "Follow a small cute robot in a puzzle game where nature suffers the consequences of a reckless past! Help H.O.P.E. decipher a strange language and create a new world where, this time, there is a little hope.",
        "supported_languages": "Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, English<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
